    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Optimization Highlights\n1. **SplitInBatches**: Processes rows individually to handle API rate limits and isolate errors.\n2. **Error Handling**: Critical nodes use 'Continue On Fail'. 'If' nodes check for success. If failed, it routes to 'Update Sheet (Failed)' to mark the row without stopping the whole workflow.\n3. **Image Logic**: Corrected flow: DALL-E (URL) -> HTTP Request (Download Binary) -> WP (Upload Binary) -> WP (Attach to Post).\n4. **Data Aggregation**: Uses 'Set Context' and 'Aggregate Data' nodes to pass variables cleanly, reducing brittle references.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 500
      },
